<title>CHINA: BANKERS TRUST SETS WARRANTS ON HK CONGLOMERATES.</title>
<headline>BANKERS TRUST SETS WARRANTS ON HK CONGLOMERATES.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust International Plc said on Thursday it launched five billion American style call warrants on a basket of Hong Kong conglomerates.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Shum Yip Invetment Ltd			0.020 shrs</p>
<p> China Merchants Holdings Int'l Co Ltd   0.010 shrs</p>
<p> CITIC Pacific Ltd			     0.005 shrs</p>
<p> Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$0.6610	  PREMIUM    26.32 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.0174	  GEARING    3.8X</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT  HK$0.6610	  PAYDATE    2 WKS FROM LAUNCH</p>
<p> MATURITY	  05.JUN.98	  LISTING    HONG KONG</p>
<p> LOT SIZE	  200,000</p>
<p> NOTE		PHYSICAL SHARES WITH CASH ALTERNATIVE AT</p>
<p>		     ISSUER'S DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
